  m_Name: Building Bridges
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: 'Split into two teams. Each team must build a bridge out of popsicle
    sticks and hot glue. Your bridge should be designed to span a three-foot gap
    and should have a platform where Jenga blocks can be stacked. Once the bridges
    are complete, we''ll set them up and stack Jenga blocks on them until they break.
    The bridge that can hold the most blocks wins, and all members of that team get
    2 marks.


    You have 30 minutes to build your bridge. Good luck! Also, please
    try not to get hot glue everywhere.'
